{"id":"n36525-1-12","stage":2,"title":"금년 · 今年","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36525-1-12-1","ko":"네가 금년에 몇 살이지?","zh":"你今年多大了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금년에","meaning":"今年","explanation":"금년：今年；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"금년","audio":"/audio/2c85ad9fc21087c89d37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36525","senseId":"1","lemma":"금년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살이지?","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"2c85ad9fc21087c8","term":"금년","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/2c85ad9fc21087c89d37.mp3","entryId":"36525","definition":"现在的这一年。","pronunciation":["금년"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"67887","definition":"计算年龄的数量单位。","pronunciation":["살"]}],"audio":"/audio/d3dc2c5609b6384a997a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n36525-1-12-2","ko":"올해로 스무 살이 되었어요.","zh":"我今年已经二十岁了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해로","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"스무","meaning":"二十","explanation":"스무：二十","readings":[{"term":"스무","audio":"/audio/f2a3c2a22b0891b766bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17822","senseId":"1","lemma":"스무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살이","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었어요.","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"f2a3c2a22b0891b7","term":"스무","zh":"二十","audio":"/audio/f2a3c2a22b0891b766bf.mp3","entryId":"17822","definition":"二十的。","pronunciation":["스무"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"67887","definition":"计算年龄的数量单位。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f92965c0a602c6768ad0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.477,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=36525","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":62,"sequenceScore":1.3037,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你今年多大了？","我今年已经二十岁了。","敏俊今年是二十八岁吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你今年多大了？","我今年已经二十岁了。","敏俊今年是二十八岁吧？"],"answer":1}]}
